  "name": "League Champions & Rift Quality Pack test / \u82f1\u96c4\u4e0e\u5ce1\u8c37\u54c1\u8d28\u5347\u7ea7 test",
  "author": "BoDUD",
  "version": "0.12.0",
  "description": "PR #11 integration test build for the current Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.7 QA target, compiled through the official base 0.5.1 Mod API 0.8 SDK. It preserves the Urgot 008, Shen and Ban/Pick compatibility fixes from PR #11 while absorbing PR #10's final stateless Yone Q/W/R implementation. Steel and Azakana attacks, Q1/Q2, Q3 and W Spirit Cleave use dedicated CasterAnimation at tick 0. The unique asset/lol_mod/aseprite_resources/champions/yone_v7 actor key contains the V7 4262x88 atlas while byte-identical yone sheet and anim aliases protect saved seasons that still reference the 3502x88 native prefix. The 0.10.5 W save floor, 0.10.17 UI route and 0.10.20 final Yone behavior remain current; Version 0.10.19 is retained as partial history only. Retired Yone E behavior and visual resources are removed; old embedded save names resolve only through no-op compatibility aliases. Urgot passive cooldown state is isolated by simulation seed and bounded by TTL/LRU cleanup so hidden simulations cannot consume live-match state. Broad legacy client/server extensions still require explicit opt-in, while the narrowly scoped Yone portrait extension remains the default UI path.",
  "last_updated": "2026-09-01",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.1"
    }
  ]
}
